ido). No lee ni recopila contenido de la pantalla.";app_block_service_description,3,V200020051,f400020143,;"Permet à Wityu d'appliquer les limites d'utilisation définies par le responsable (ferme les applis bloquées ou hors des horaires autorisés). Ne lit ni ne collecte le contenu de l'écran.";app_block_admin_disable_warning,0,V2000f0508,a7000f05ad,;"Se você desativar\, a proteção do Wityu poderá ser removida deste aparelho e seus responsáveis serão avisados.";app_block_admin_disable_warning,1,V2000f04e4,a8000f058a,;"If you turn this off\, Wityu's protection can be removed from this device and your guardians will be notified.";app_block_admin_disable_warning,2,V2000f0526,aa000f05ce,;"Si lo desactivas\, la protección de Wityu podrá eliminarse de este dispositivo y tus responsables serán avisados.";app_block_admin_disable_warning,3,V2000f0555,b0000f0603,;"Si tu désactives ceci\, la protection de Wityu pourra être retirée de cet appareil et tes responsables seront prévenus.";app_block_admin_description,0,V2000e045a,ad000e0505,;"Impede que o Wityu seja desinstalado ou desativado sem que os responsáveis saibam. Não apaga dados nem controla senhas.";app_block_admin_description,1,V2000e0432,b1000e04e1,;"Prevents Wityu from being uninstalled or disabled without the guardians knowing. It never wipes data or controls passwords.";app_block_admin_description,2,V2000e0475,b0000e0523,;"Impide que Wityu sea desinstalado o desactivado sin que los responsables lo sepan. No borra datos ni controla contraseñas.";app_block_admin_description,3,V2000e048d,c7000e0552,;"Empêche la désinstallation ou la désactivation de Wityu à l'insu des responsables. N'efface aucune donnée et ne contrôle pas les mots de passe.";app_block_shield_body,0,V2000501ba,5e00050216,;"Este aparelho está protegido pela sua família.";app_block_shield_body,1,V2000501b1,5800050207,;"This device is protected by your family.";app_block_shield_body,2,V2000501ce,5f0005022b,;"Este dispositivo está protegido por tu familia."